<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakh tenge falls to 75.4000 to dlr.</title>
<headline>Kazakh tenge falls to 75.4000 to dlr.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The tenge closed at 75.4000 per dollar on the Kazakhstan Currency Exchange on Wednesday after 75.3501 on Tuesday</p>
<p> TENGE PER DOLLAR	     May 28		  May 27</p>
<p> High			     75.5500		 75.5503</p>
<p> Low				75.3000		 75.3501</p>
<p> Open			     75.5005		 75.5500</p>
<p> Close			    75.4000		 75.3501</p>
<p> Volume ($ million)	    1.280		   4.110</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, + 7 3272 509410</p>
</text>
